text: |-
  Q
  4
  Drone Spy Plane N1098L
  Spy Plane N1098L @ Sept 10th. Designed to drop off/pick up drones.
  AXEL10. HADES Spy program.
  The Flight N1098L is designed to launch military drones.
  Normally flies at 41,000' altitude. Dropped to 203' altitude
  116 knots stall speed @ 9:16am MT 1-mile from UVU.
  Then looped back to 1-mile from UVU and 203' altitude @
  stall speed 25 minutes after assassination.
  24001
  487 knots speed
  41,000'
  Altitude
  LAS Ropes Course
  Powell Slough
  Nifty Productions •
